<title>USA: Lincare Holdings names Paul Gabos CFO.</title>
<headline>Lincare Holdings names Paul Gabos CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lincare Holdings Inc said Friday it had named Paul Gabos as chief financial officer, effective June 1.</p>
<p>Gabos, 32, succeeds James Emanuel, who is leaving the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Gabos has worked for Lincare since 1993, most recently as vice president, administration.</p>
